From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: jrash <johnrash@gmail.com>
Date: Wed, 28 Oct 2026 11:01:18 -0400
Subject: [PATCH 025/342] arm64: deliver SIGILL for undefined instructions from
 userland

do_sync_handler() mapped only alignment faults, aborts and system calls;
for any other exception class, an undefined instruction (EC 0) above
all, signalNumber, signalCode and exceptionType were uninitialized, so a
program's SIGILL handler never ran and the debugger got a garbage event.
Programs probe for optional CPU features exactly this way: OpenSSL's
ARMv8 crypto probes stopped every program using OpenSSL on the
ODROID-C2, whose Cortex-A53s have no crypto extensions.

Undefined instructions now raise SIGILL (ILL_ILLOPC), BRK raises SIGTRAP
(TRAP_BRKPT), and any other unexpected exception class SIGILL
(ILL_ILLTRP).

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
---
 src/system/kernel/arch/arm64/arch_int.cpp | 29 ++++++++++++++++++++---
 1 file changed, 26 insertions(+), 3 deletions(-)

diff --git a/src/system/kernel/arch/arm64/arch_int.cpp b/src/system/kernel/arch/arm64/arch_int.cpp
index 6cde153200..5b4d0b24a3 100644
--- a/src/system/kernel/arch/arm64/arch_int.cpp
+++ b/src/system/kernel/arch/arm64/arch_int.cpp
@@ -259,9 +259,9 @@ do_sync_handler(iframe * frame)
 #endif
 
 	InterruptScope scope(frame);
-	debug_exception_type exceptionType;
-	uint32 signalNumber;
-	int32 signalCode;
+	debug_exception_type exceptionType = B_INVALID_OPCODE_EXCEPTION;
+	uint32 signalNumber = SIGILL;
+	int32 signalCode = ILL_ILLTRP;
 	uint64 signalAddress = 0;
 
 	bool isUser = (frame->spsr & PSR_M_MASK) == PSR_M_EL0t;
@@ -273,6 +273,21 @@ do_sync_handler(iframe * frame)
 			signalCode = BUS_ADRALN;
 			signalAddress = frame->elr;
 			break;
+		case EXCP_UNKNOWN:
+			// An undefined instruction. Programs probe for optional CPU
+			// features this way (OpenSSL's ARMv8 crypto probes) and expect
+			// SIGILL.
+			exceptionType = B_INVALID_OPCODE_EXCEPTION;
+			signalNumber = SIGILL;
+			signalCode = ILL_ILLOPC;
+			signalAddress = frame->elr;
+			break;
+		case EXCP_BRK:
+			exceptionType = B_INVALID_OPCODE_EXCEPTION;
+			signalNumber = SIGTRAP;
+			signalCode = TRAP_BRKPT;
+			signalAddress = frame->elr;
+			break;
 		case EXCP_INSN_ABORT_L:
 		case EXCP_INSN_ABORT:
 			isExec = true;
@@ -386,6 +401,14 @@ do_sync_handler(iframe * frame)
 			syscall_dispatcher(syscall, (void*)args, &frame->x[0]);
 			return;
 		}
+
+		default:
+			// any other exception class: no garbage signal for userland
+			exceptionType = B_INVALID_OPCODE_EXCEPTION;
+			signalNumber = SIGILL;
+			signalCode = ILL_ILLTRP;
+			signalAddress = frame->elr;
+			break;
 	}
 
 	if (isUser) {
